ourse_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14046753/state.json" "file_sha256" "019c2b25f329e6c9df6ac453626d05fd762f0bbe3a38ed201401092e46827f55"} {"question" "q-18377" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $a=⟨0,-3,1⟩$ and $b=⟨\\sqrt{2},1,0⟩.$ Find the vector projection of $a$ onto $b.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14046753/state.json" "file_sha256" "019c2b25f329e6c9df6ac453626d05fd762f0bbe3a38ed201401092e46827f55"} {"question" "q-18377" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{b\\cdot b}b \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{0\\cdot \\sqrt{2}+(-3)\\cdot 1+1\\cdot 0}{(\\sqrt{2})^{2}+{1}^{2}+{0}^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{-3}{3}⟨\\sqrt{2},1,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\sqrt{2},-1,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14046753/state.json" "file_sha256" "019c2b25f329e6c9df6ac453626d05fd762f0bbe3a38ed201401092e46827f55"} {"question" "q-18377" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14046753/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e6fe8f0b00258bee9b2b21577475e5a48381bafc9b7690de1fb8c376e61486fc"} {"question" "q-18377" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14046753/state.json" "file_sha256" "019c2b25f329e6c9df6ac453626d05fd762f0bbe3a38ed201401092e46827f55"} {"question" "q-18377" "field" "selection" "attribute" "